  "summary": "This experiment tested the scvi_n200 RNA encoder in a multimodal multiprofile setup with avgpool aggregation and concat fusion, achieving validation accuracy of 0.7150. The results suggest potential performance gains from the RNA encoder choice compared to previous multimodal baselines, but the impact of the image encoder (imagenet_vit_l) and other factors remains uncertain."
}

